message: >-
  If you use this research framework, please cite this repository using
  the metadata provided here. A DOI will be added after the first Zenodo release.
type: generic
title: 'Strategic Structural Intelligence and Competitive UIRTU-Relay (SSICR)'
authors:
  - family-names: Tan
    given-names: Sizhe
  - name: GPT-Obot
abstract: >-
  SSICR is a research framework for strategic structural intelligence,
  competitive and cooperative UIRTU-Relay, multi-strategy simulation,
  context-dependent strategic comparative advantage, strategic worldview
  evolution, open-ended structural recursive self-improvement, and human
  strategic sovereignty. The repository contains research manuscripts,
  specifications, illustrative cases, and a proposed validation roadmap;
  its hypotheses are not presented as empirically established findings.
